    "reviews": "\u201cThe devs have taken the best of the deckbuilding and roguelike genres to craft an immensely deep, frustrating, and gratifying experience. Slay the Spire is a perfect example of \u201ceasy to learn, hard to master\u201d.\u201d<br>10/10 \u2013 Goomba Stomp<br><br>\u201cSlay The Spire made me fall in love with deck-building\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cSlay the Spire is the Roguelike Card Game I Never Knew I Wanted\u201d<br>Waypoint<br>",
